          "en": "(gentle music)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.88,
          "end": 6.03,
          "en": "-: Now let's understand how Maven works behind the scene.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.03,
          "end": 8.82,
          "en": "Of course, it's not required to know the concept,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.82,
          "end": 10.44,
          "en": "but what if you get stuck somewhere",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.44,
          "end": 13.98,
          "en": "because sometime you will get dependencies issue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.98,
          "end": 15.51,
          "en": "you will have some version issue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.51,
          "end": 17.13,
          "en": "and then at that point you need to know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.13,
          "end": 18.09,
          "en": "how do you resolve it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 19.89,
          "en": "It will be easier for you to resolve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 19.89,
          "end": 21.96,
          "en": "if you understand what is happening behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 21.96,
          "end": 22.95,
          "en": "So let's understand this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 22.95,
          "end": 24.96,
          "en": "And the focus is mostly for the dependencies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 24.96,
          "end": 25.83,
          "en": "not for the plugins.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 25.83,
          "end": 28.32,
          "en": "So here, let's talk about how Maven works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 28.32,
          "end": 29.52,
          "en": "to resolve the dependencies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 29.52,
          "end": 31.8,
          "en": "Now, what happens is for every project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 33.51,
          "en": "when you go to your pom.xml,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 33.51,
          "end": 35.43,
          "en": "and when you add the dependencies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 35.43,
          "end": 37.957,
          "en": "what happens is, you are asking Maven,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 37.957,
          "end": 39.12,
          "en": "\"Hey, you know Maven,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 39.12,
          "end": 41.28,
          "en": "I want these dependencies from the internet.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 41.28,
          "end": 45.27,
          "en": "So it says, \"Hey, Maven, I need these dependencies.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 45.27,
          "end": 47.64,
          "en": "But conceptualize how Maven will know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 47.64,
          "end": 49.44,
          "en": "from where to get these dependencies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 49.44,
          "end": 50.61,
          "en": "Does it mean that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 50.61,
          "end": 52.71,
          "en": "the moment you install Maven on your machine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 52.71,
          "end": 54.54,
          "en": "you will get all the dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 54.54,
          "end": 56.49,
          "en": "all over the world in your machine?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 56.49,
          "end": 59.1,
          "en": "Of course not, right? It will make your machines very bulky.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 59.1,
          "end": 61.02,
          "en": "And even if you have 10 TB hard drive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 61.02,
          "end": 62.13,
          "en": "I think it'll not be enough,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 62.13,
          "end": 64.23,
          "en": "because a lot of libraries are available in the world.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 64.23,
          "end": 66.157,
          "en": "So what happens is, when you say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 66.157,
          "end": 68.55,
          "en": "\"Hey, Maven, I want this dependencies.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 68.55,
          "end": 70.47,
          "en": "Maven says, \"Okay, I'll give you some time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 70.47,
          "end": 72.15,
          "en": "I will you give this file.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 72.15,
          "end": 75.48,
          "en": "So what it does is, it first search for the file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 75.48,
          "end": 76.98,
          "en": "in your local machine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 76.98,
          "end": 77.813,
          "en": "But where?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 77.813,
          "end": 81.18,
          "en": "So, basically, every Maven or every machine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 81.18,
          "end": 82.35,
          "en": "when you have a Maven installed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 82.35,
          "end": 84.48,
          "en": "will have something called a M2 folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 84.48,
          "end": 87.63,
          "en": "Okay, so in your local drive, in your machine basically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 87.63,
          "end": 89.19,
          "en": "if you're using Mac or Windows,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 89.19,
          "end": 91.47,
          "en": "if you're using Windows search for the M2 folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 91.47,
          "end": 92.49000000000001,
          "en": "it should be somewhere else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 92.49000000000001,
          "end": 95.58,
          "en": "In Mac, it basically is in your Home folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 95.58,
          "end": 96.99000000000001,
          "en": "It's just that it is hidden folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 96.99000000000001,
          "end": 99.03,
          "en": "so you can use Command + Shift + dot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 99.03,
          "end": 100.68,
          "en": "to view all the hidden folders.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 100.68,
          "end": 103.14,
          "en": "In Windows, it should be in the documents,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 103.14,
          "end": 104.1,
          "en": "just search for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 104.1,
          "end": 106.28999999999999,
          "en": "So, basically, in the M2 folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 108.18,
          "en": "you will see this option of repository.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 108.18,
          "end": 111.45,
          "en": "Now, in my machine, I have all these folders,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 111.45,
          "end": 113.1,
          "en": "but if you're using Maven for the first time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 113.1,
          "end": 115.11,
          "en": "you will not have any folder here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 115.11,
          "end": 116.28,
          "en": "So what happened is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 116.28,
          "end": 119.7,
          "en": "every time you use Maven to get some dependencies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 119.7,
          "end": 123.57,
          "en": "Maven will have a copy of it inside your local machine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 123.57,
          "end": 126.21,
          "en": "So example, if I delete all these dependencies here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 126.21,
          "end": 127.29,
          "en": "I'm a bit scared to do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 127.29,
          "end": 128.91,
          "en": "because there might be some dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 128.91,
          "end": 130.74,
          "en": "which is getting used by some of my projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 130.74,
          "end": 132.09,
          "en": "but that's fine, I will redownload them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 132.09,
          "end": 133.8,
          "en": "So if I move this to bin,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 133.8,
          "end": 135.33,
          "en": "you can see these are empty now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 135.33,
          "end": 137.407,
          "en": "So what was happening is, every time I was saying,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 137.407,
          "end": 139.8,
          "en": "\"Hey, Maven, I need this dependency,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 139.8,
          "end": 142.32,
          "en": "Maven was like, \"Okay, let me search that thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 142.32,
          "end": 145.68,
          "en": "in the local machine first,\" in the M2 folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 145.68,
          "end": 147.72,
          "en": "If it is there, that's great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 147.72,
          "end": 148.8,
          "en": "What if it's not there?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 148.8,
          "end": 152.28,
          "en": "In that case, it goes to the Maven Central,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 152.28,
          "end": 154.17000000000002,
          "en": "and from there it downloads a dependency.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 154.17000000000002,
          "end": 155.003,
          "en": "It's that simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 155.003,
          "end": 156.48,
          "en": "And next time when you want to use it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 156.48,
          "end": 158.57999999999998,
          "en": "you have a copy of it in your local machine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 158.57999999999998,
          "end": 160.56,
          "en": "So example, if I look at this project now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 160.56,
          "end": 162.3,
          "en": "and if I refresh,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 162.3,
          "end": 163.29,
          "en": "I think, yeah,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 163.29,
          "end": 164.73,
          "en": "so you can see all the dependencies is gone,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 164.73,
          "end": 166.77,
          "en": "it's because we have deleted everything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 166.77,
          "end": 169.26,
          "en": "And now if I can refresh this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 169.26,
          "end": 171.66,
          "en": "then it will start downloading dependency again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 171.66,
          "end": 172.92000000000002,
          "en": "So that's how basically it works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 172.92000000000002,
          "end": 175.77,
          "en": "So when you say, \"Hey, Maven, I need a dependency.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 175.77,
          "end": 178.05,
          "en": "Maven says, \"Okay, let me check in the local folder.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 178.05,
          "end": 180.66,
          "en": "If it is not there, I will go to the remote repository.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 180.66,
          "end": 182.55,
          "en": "But there's only one little problem here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 182.55,
          "end": 184.92,
          "en": "The problem is, if you say you have a library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 184.92,
          "end": 188.55,
          "en": "on the Maven repository or any central repository,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 188.55,
          "end": 191.82,
          "en": "do you think all the libraries are safe?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 191.82,
          "end": 193.47,
          "en": "Because if they're not safe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 193.47,
          "end": 195.24,
          "en": "basically your project is not safe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 195.24,
          "end": 197.57999999999998,
          "en": "So you have to make sure that you're using only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 197.57999999999998,
          "end": 199.62,
          "en": "the library which are safe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 199.62,
          "end": 202.92000000000002,
          "en": "In fact, in IntelliJ, it gives you a warning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 202.92000000000002,
          "end": 205.44,
          "en": "If you can see, it says \"Dependency Maven...\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 205.44,
          "end": 207.81,
          "en": "this particular version is vulnerable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 207.81,
          "end": 210.54,
          "en": "So, basically, most of the libraries",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 210.54,
          "end": 212.28,
          "en": "which you use are vulnerable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 212.28,
          "end": 213.87,
          "en": "and that's why you get updates for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 213.87,
          "end": 215.82,
          "en": "So make sure that this version is updated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 215.82,
          "end": 217.41,
          "en": "So there might be some issue with their version here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 217.41,
          "end": 219.87,
          "en": "So what you can do is you can go to Maven repository again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 219.87,
          "end": 221.4,
          "en": "and when you search for extra database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 221.4,
          "end": 223.53,
          "en": "on the Maven repository,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 223.53,
          "end": 225,
          "en": "if you go here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 225,
          "end": 226.86,
          "en": "it will also mention which are vulnerable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 226.86,
          "end": 228.72,
          "en": "So you can see this version is vulnerable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 228.72,
          "end": 231.3,
          "en": "So what you can do is you can simply update your version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 231.3,
          "end": 234.27,
          "en": "You can copy this from here and replace this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 234.27,
          "end": 236.19,
          "en": "So now what you're doing is, you are making sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 236.19,
          "end": 238.44,
          "en": "that you're using a safe version, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 238.44,
          "end": 240.36,
          "en": "Now, is it really safe?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 240.36,
          "end": 243.046,
          "en": "The thing is, maybe it is not tested properly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 243.046,
          "end": 246.12,
          "en": "or there's no bugs found yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 246.12,
          "end": 247.38,
          "en": "but in future it might.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 247.38,
          "end": 248.49,
          "en": "So most of the companies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 248.49,
          "end": 251.7,
          "en": "if they have security as their first priority,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 251.7,
          "end": 253.59,
          "en": "so what they will do is, they will not be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 253.59,
          "end": 255.84,
          "en": "directly connecting with the remote repository.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 255.84,
          "end": 257.46,
          "en": "They will have one more layer in between,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 257.46,
          "end": 259.35,
          "en": "which is company-wide repository.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 259.35,
          "end": 262.35,
          "en": "So company will also have their own repository,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 262.35,
          "end": 266.07,
          "en": "and only those libraries are there, which are well tested.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 266.07,
          "end": 267.81,
          "en": "So, basically, as a developer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 267.81,
          "end": 269.46,
          "en": "when you say, \"Hey, I want this dependency,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 269.46,
          "end": 270.69,
          "en": "Maven will say, \"Okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 270.69,
          "end": 272.76,
          "en": "let me check that in the local first.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 272.76,
          "end": 273.593,
          "en": "If it is not there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 273.593,
          "end": 275.88,
          "en": "I will check for the company repository, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
